WEBVTT

00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:45.110
At Industrial 7,
the place where it all began,

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:50.400
Banagher has been entrusted
with Laplace's Box by Syam Vist.

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:53.480
He leaves Mineva at Syam's side

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:57.230
in order to reveal the truth
about the Box to the entire world.

00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:58.900
And he goes to face Full Frontal,

00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:01.280
who is trying to take
possession of the Box himself.

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.110
What brought you here

00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:04.570
was your own free will.

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:07.110
Not some curse.

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.650
Continue onward, never wavering...

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:13.820
You are your father's...

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:18.280
Unicorn!

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:21.400
Together with Riddhe Marcenas,

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:23.230
Banagher and his Unicorn Gundam

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:26.610
confront the huge mobile suit armor
Neo Zeong.

00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:32.440
Let's do this, Banagher. This light
isn't coming only from us.

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:33.980
I know.

00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:36.030
Everyone is inside it.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:40.230
At the end of their fierce battle,

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:44.110
Banagher and Frontal
are enveloped in a psycho-field.

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:49.480
The miracle is repeating itself...

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:52.320
And nothing will change.

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:57.780
Meanwhile Martha Carbine has targeted
Magallanica with a colony laser,

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.570
a powerful weapon,

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:01.610
in a scheme to eliminate Laplace's Box

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:03.860
along with the Unicorn Gundam for good.

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:08.440
There are times when you must sacrifice
the few so the many might live.

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:15.360
Ensign Riddhe is there!

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:50.190
(RETUR)

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:51.860
(RETUR)

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:51.900
(RETUR)

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:54.690
(RETUR)
Shadow observed in
the vicinity of Luna II.

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:55.360
(RETUR)

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:58.480
It's huge! Measurements show it
to be object of colony size!

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.780
The colony... laser?

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:08.730
I hadn't heard anything about
Gryps 2 being repaired!

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.730
Please evacuate the Nahel Argama
from this sector right away!

00:05:12.780 --> 00:05:15.780
I'll put up a psycho-field
in front of Magallanica.

00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:18.280
Banagher!

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:19.900
Banagher...

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:24.360
That's crazy! The properties of a
psycho-field are completely unknown!

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:26.730
Audrey, you can hear me too, right?

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:30.860
Take that man with you and
evacuate to Industrial 7 right away.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:32.360
Banagher?

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:34.280
That kid...

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:38.860
We will stay here.

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:40.480
Audrey!

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:45.360
You're confident, aren't you?
Then go prove it.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:48.150
And make sure that you come back.

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:50.400
Breaking your word
will not be tolerated.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:54.400
She's right! You have to come back!

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:56.360
Don't you dare die, Banagher!

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:58.980
Too many people have died already!

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:01.860
Banagher, don't die.
Banagher, don't die.

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:04.980
Banagher, let's go back
to school together, you hear?

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:07.280
Even if you've got a job with
the Federation Forces,

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:09.360
you've gotta finish high school!

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:11.280
You guys...

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:13.230
Let me join you.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.230
Mr. Riddhe...

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:17.860
The Banshee is a psycho-machine, too.
It will help.

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:22.190
Laplace's Box isn't just
an issue for your family.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:25.280
Our ancestors who ushered
in the Universal Century

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:28.940
didn't simply abandon the excess
human population in space.

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:32.820
They embraced a glimmer
of hope for the distant future

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:35.820
and sent them out with as big
a prayer as they could offer.

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:42.230
Will that be turned into a curse?
Or can we turn it into possibility?

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:43.230
That's up to...

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:48.190
There's no harm in knowing

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:52.400
that we were blessed when
we came into this world.

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:55.070
If they'd just said that
in the first place,

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:56.360
it would've been easier to understand.

00:06:57.110 --> 00:07:00.570
Fathers never say enough
to their children.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:05.070
The kids always have to fill in
the blanks on their own.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:08.280
It's disastrous, isn't it?

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:11.860
Yeah.

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:23.980
- Can't you stop it?!
- Impossible!

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:25.860
It's already approaching critical!

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:28.280
If I abort now, there's no telling
what kind of accident will happen!

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:31.780
Gryps 2 has over a
thousand people on board!

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:34.820
Comms! Send a laser message!

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:37.110
Contact the Nahel Argama at once!

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:39.570
...adjusting to achieve
four-dimensional coherence.

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:42.070
Chassis, agitation due to
resonant oscillation waves.

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:44.480
30. 29.

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:48.360
28. 27. 26.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:52.230
25. 24. 23.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:57.320
22. 21. 20. 19.

00:07:57.360 --> 00:08:03.230
18. 17. 16. 15. 14.

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:08.230
13. 12. 11. 10.

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:10.570
9. 8.

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:13.280
7. 6.

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:15.780
5. 4.

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:17.440
Ri...

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:18.900
Banagher!

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:38.690
I can see things the rest
of you can't see now.

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:42.610
Here, even time seems to glow.

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:45.650
No matter how deep the despair,
hope is always born out of it.

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:48.610
You are light.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:52.230
Use even sadness as fuel
and light the way.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:54.190
Together with the Princess.

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:59.530
Humanity is standing
on a threshold now.

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:03.070
One day, the time might come
when they will cross it

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:05.570
while still in their physical bodies.

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:10.860
The road leads here, over the rainbow.

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:17.230
Direct hit.

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:19.900
Target is emitting powerful
electromagnetic radiation.

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:22.610
Direct hit.

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:24.940
Target is emitting powerful
electromagnetic radiation.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:29.770
Optical observation impaired
due to gasified debris.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:31.810
Firing evaluation analysis
will take time.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:35.860
Von Braun on moon reports same.
Analysis now in- -

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:43.190
Greetings, people of Earth, of space,
everyone living in this world.

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:47.860
I am Mineva Lao Zabi.

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:50.650
Please forgive me for addressing

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:51.810
What is this?

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:54.900
- Where is she transmitting from?!
- you all in this manner.

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:56.230
Pinpointing signal source...

00:10:57.440 --> 00:10:59.400
It's Magallanica! Target is intact!

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:04.900
I am the heir to the Zabi family that
once led the Principality of Zeon.

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:07.150
No external damage observed at all!

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:10.980
However, the matter I am
about to discuss

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:13.940
has nothing to do with my lineage.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:18.400
Today, I learned a secret that affects

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:21.770
the very foundation of the
Federation government.

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:26.020
I would like to inform you all
of this secret,

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:30.730
simply as one human being
who lives in this world.

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:33.650
The Charter of the Universal Century

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:36.440
was proclaimed at the dawn
of the Universal Century.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:39.480
As I am sure you all know,

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:42.610
this monument is the foundation
of the Federation government

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:44.940
and the keystone of its policy-making.

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:47.900
It was always believed that the
monument, which was erected

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:50.690
96 years ago within Laplace,
the prime minister's residence,

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:55.770
was lost in the terrorist
bombing immediately afterwards.

00:11:57.270 --> 00:12:00.770
However, it was not lost.

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:05.520
While a replica monument was displayed at
the Federation assembly building in Dakar,

00:12:06.020 --> 00:12:09.520
the original has been
kept hidden all these years.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:14.270
Please look.

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:18.980
What you see behind me now

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:23.020
is the real Charter of the Universal
Century that was erected in Laplace.

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.270
I believe you have noticed it.

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:35.270
The genuine Charter
of the Universal Century

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:39.690
contained an article
that we have never seen.

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:44.270
I could use about a dozen skilled
people to helm this thing!

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:48.270
You heard the man.
Would you mind, Captain?

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:56.020
When this is over, let's have a drink.

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:00.940
Agreed.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:02.150
Good luck.

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:06.400
Ensign Riddhe, please rendezvous with
the Nahel Argama immediately.

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:09.060
Federation fleet has begun moving.

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:12.940
Objective believed to be seizing
Magallanica and terminating broadcast.

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:20.900
Zeon Deikun proposed his Newtype
theory more than 40 years

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.440
after this charter was created.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:28.230
I believe that this one passage, which
was buried with the Laplace Incident,

00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:32.900
was nothing more than a prayer
offered up to the distant future.

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:38.900
But that coincidence has transformed
this charter into a curse.

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:45.190
What would happen if this passage
were linked to Zeon's Newtype theory

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:48.980
and spurred on the Spacenoid
independence movement?

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:52.110
This monument, which
originally did nothing more

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:54.860
than show the truth behind
the Laplace Incident,

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:57.980
has since become an object of fear,

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:01.230
something which could topple
the Federation government.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:04.770
Fearing its very existence,
the Federation conspired with

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:08.150
the Vist Foundation, which had
the monument in its possession,

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:12.650
to keep it sealed away,
calling it Laplace's Box.

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:17.110
This may have been a misdeed,

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:21.980
but it was also a decision that had to
be made in order to maintain peace.

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:27.190
However, as a result of this decision
being passed down as an institution,

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:30.110
the original intent of the Box was lost,

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:34.310
and a mindset that shunned anything
resembling Newtypes took root.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:39.310
After the nightmare
of the One Year War,

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:42.480
that mindset became the very core of the
Federation government's inflexibility.

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.480
Magallanica has begun to move!

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:45.440
That's...

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.900
That's no colony builder!

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:51.650
It's him! He's relaying the
transmission through the Unicorn!

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:53.860
He's resonating the psycho-fields!

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:56.730
Send the General Revil there at once!

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:58.110
We can take care of this.

00:14:58.150 --> 00:15:00.730
How many people do you think
there are in the world

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:03.190
who can comprehend the true
meaning of this broadcast?

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:06.730
This will stir up the activists, which
will amount to exactly nothing.

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:09.940
The government simply needs to announce
that this is fabricated nonsense, and- -

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:14.060
Naturally, the military will take
appropriate action.

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:18.480
However, you, a civilian, have no
say in that particular matter.

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:22.310
It's time to let it go, Aunt Martha.

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:26.270
The Box's magic has been lost.

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.150
Alberto...

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:33.020
It's over. Let's make a fresh start.

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:38.020
Martha Vist Carbine.

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:43.980
I have a great many questions
for you regarding this incident.

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:45.440
Please come with us.

00:16:23.110 --> 00:16:25.400
The choice is theirs to make.

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:31.400
We have no alternative but to accept it.

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:34.110
As fathers.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:23.150
Captain!

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:40.360
"...of a new space-adapted
human race be confirmed,

00:17:41.230 --> 00:17:44.020
the Earth Federation shall give
priority to involving them

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:45.400
in the administration
of the government."

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:48.860
On that last night
of the old calendar...

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:52.560
Mobile suits launched from the
General Revil are headed this way!

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:53.900
A swarm of them!

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:56.940
We'll move this behemoth
to a safe zone!

00:17:56.980 --> 00:17:59.110
Can you keep up, Nahel Argama?

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:01.980
We'll manage! Don't worry
about us, just keep going!

00:18:02.020 --> 00:18:03.690
Until this transmission ends, we- -

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:06.400
We'll keep Her Highness safe!

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:09.770
Let's go too, Banagher.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:14.770
Your job is over.
Laplace's Box has been opened.

00:18:14.810 --> 00:18:17.690
Head back to the ship
and get some rest.

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:21.650
After all, you've just been born...

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:23.650
Banagher.

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:36.060
Is this... a perfected Newtype?

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:40.560
You always rush into things!

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:43.560
Nobody wants an outcome like that.

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:46.310
Just having the possibility,
that's enough!

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:51.770
You and I still have a lot of things
left to do in this world, right?!

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:55.360
I'm gonna drag you back here!

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:56.770
Banshee!

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:09.610
How are you supposed to
hold Mineva like that?

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:13.690
I'm gonna steal Audrey
from you, Banagher!

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:22.810
Everyone who is listening
to this broadcast,

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:26.610
please discern the truth
with your own eyes.

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:32.480
And then, just as
people did a century ago,

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:38.060
I'd like you to usher in the next century
with goodwill in your hearts.

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:41.560
Believing in the God

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:44.610
called "possibility" that
lies dormant within us all.

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:17.440
Audrey...
